#
#   3. If you already have a deployment from before: Deploy -> Manage
#      deployments -> Edit (pencil) -> Version: "New version" -> Deploy.
#      Editing the script does NOT update the live /exec URL by itself.
#      First time deploying: Deploy -> New deployment -> type "Web app" ->
#      Execute as "Me" -> Who has access "Anyone" -> Deploy. Authorize when
#      prompted.
#   4. Copy the Web App URL (ends in /exec) into this variable — it's the
#      same URL as before if you're just updating an existing deployment.
GOOGLE_SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/your_deployment_id/exec
